Scaled by:         2147483647.0
Maximum amplitude:     {max_amp:8.6f}
Minimum amplitude:     {min_amp:8.6f}
Midline amplitude:     {midline:8.6f}
Mean    norm:          {mean_norm:8.6f}
Mean    amplitude:     {mean_amp:8.6f}
